{"title":"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For unequal real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/1/411e8b2b30fbb26e55ed0d28303d10fa81aa5606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3767f0665ea4d5f0e9c58452fc5782b42a8a65a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48d77f0b4db2fcb2edb66129b3709763fd6cb83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{k}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20f86675473d4e45e9b22d016bf9562016f0ea47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f_{k}(x) = \\left|\\frac{\\log_{x}\\left(\\log_{x}k\\right)}{\\log_{k}\\left(\\log_{k}x\\right)}\\right|.\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"44\" /> For some positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, it is given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f527361fe3eff4e75d5483ed79e769ea64f0557e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{\\substack{d \\mid n \\\\ 1 &lt; d &lt; n}} f_{d}(n) = 9.\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"52\" /> Find the least possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17c794df929c9e7614bb0813bc154a62f1f17f1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = k^{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc0b45d3b105633ee5e62516a998e3469ca36d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f_{k}(x) = \\left|\\frac{\\log_{k^{a}}\\left(\\log_{k^{a}}k\\right)}{\\log_{k}\\left(\\log_{k}k^{a}\\right)}\\right| = \\left|\\frac{\\log_{k^{a}}\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)}{\\log_{k}a}\\right| = \\left|- \\frac{\\log_{k^{a}}a}{\\log_{k}a}\\right| = \\left|- \\frac{\\tfrac{\\log a}{a \\log k}}{\\tfrac{\\log a}{\\log k}}\\right| = \\left|- \\frac{1}{a}\\right| = \\left|\\frac{1}{a}\\right|.\\]\" width=\"619\" height=\"54\" /> Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b74d9518f1d237ff10348ecad9030a4edf9c406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_{k}(x) = \\frac{1}{\\log_{k}x} = \\log_{x}k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"186\" height=\"43\" />. So we need to find the least positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/5/0c513bd243ed40724290fbc671228d6b1a67ed0e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{\\substack{d \\mid n \\\\ 1 &lt; d &lt; n}} \\log_{n}d = 9.\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"52\" /> That is to say, there are exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> unordered pairs of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/97525ac5d5412a538108ff14c0cb8f6d21c43269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(d, \\tfrac{n}{d}\\right) \\neq (1, n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"114\" height=\"24\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11c2b822ff652f94319050de3fb02d04b053d3b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d \\neq \\tfrac{n}{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"48\" height=\"21\" />, as each such pair increases the value of the total sum by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> positive integer divisors not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or itself, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in total. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/31229b8a1b6695477cc2f6a312184fde48dcef16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 = 5 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"14\" />. The least such <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, therefore, is obviously <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/0/2c07a0f3a56764cafe009f95143ba9759d09601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4} \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 = \\boxed{240}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"126\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I\" title=\"2021 CIME I\">2021 CIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2021\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CIME Problems and Solutions\"> All CIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018014715\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 185/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1475/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4606/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.071      1 -total\n 73.68%    7.420      1 Template:CIME_box\n 23.26%    2.343      1 Template:MAC_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32417:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018014715 and revision id 251101. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}